OL,3,AMultiple deaths after crash between
OL,4,Apolice vehicle and car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesman said: "Sadly, the
OL,7,Fcollision has resulted in multiple
OL,8,Ffatalities. We are working to identify
OL,9,Fthe victims and contact their
OL,10,Ffamilies."
